{"Title":"An Act changing the name of the Mohawk Trail Woodlands Partnership to the Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts","BillNumber":"S2993","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"S29","Name":"Senate Committee on Rules","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29","ResponseDate":"2024-12-16T11:20:29.247"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-01-16T08:56:24.8233333"},{"Id":"NMB1","Name":"Natalie M. Blais","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NMB1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-21T15:50:27.04"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2993/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 89 of chapter 209 of the acts of 2018 is hereby amended by striking out, each time they appear, the words “Mohawk Trail Woodlands Partnership” and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 89 of said chapter 209 is hereby further amended by striking out the words “Mohawk Trail Woodland Partnership” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts.\r\n\tSECTION 3. Section 91 of said chapter 209 is hereby amended by striking out, each time they appear, the words “Mohawk Trail Woodlands Partnership” and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts.\r\n\tSECTION 4. Chapter 279 of the acts of 2018 is hereby amended by striking out, each time they appear, the words “Mohawk Trail Woodland Partnership” and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}